  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;&#xe0; la fin de ce projet  (d&#xe9;cembre 2022) : 1) acc&#xe8;s de 47 322 clients entrepreneurs, dont 18 290 femmes et 29 032 hommes, aux services financiers &#xe0; travers les Centres financiers aux entrepreneurs  et les institutions partenaires; 2) cr&#xe9;ation et maintien de 109 800 emplois  et d&#xe9;boursement de 72 165 pr&#xea;ts  &#xe0; des clients entrepreneurs, dont 25 336 (35,10 %), &#xe0; des femmes; 3) cr&#xe9;ation et  maintien d&apos;emplois de l&#x2019;ordre 37 % par an en moyenne entre 2014 et 2019 et de 20 % par an entre 2020 et 2022; cette croissance a aid&#xe9; les entrepreneurs &#xe0; affronter la pand&#xe9;mie en gardant leurs entreprises ouvertes.  Ce projet  se termine avec tous les  Centres financiers aux entrepreneurs ayant un ratio de solvabilit&#xe9; sup&#xe9;rieur &#xe0; 15 %, faisant preuve de la bonne gestion pour remplir leur mission d&#x2019;inclusion financi&#xe8;re.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of the end of the project (December 2022): (1) access to financial services for 47,322 entrepreneurs, including 18,290 women and 29,032 men, through Financial Center for Entrepreneurs and partner institutions; (2) creation and maintenance of 109,800 jobs and disbursement of 72,165 loans to entrepreneurs, including 25,336 (35.10%) to women; and (3) job creation and retention averaging 37% per year between 2014 and 2019, and 20% per year between 2020 and 2022; this growth has helped entrepreneurs better cope with the pandemic by keeping their businesses open.  At the end of the project, all Entrepreneur Financial Centers has a solvency ratio in excess of 15%, demonstrating good management in fulfilling its mission of financial inclusion.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat escompt&#xe9; de ce projet est la cr&#xe9;ation et l&#x2019;expansion durables et concurrentielles de microentreprises et de petites entreprises dirig&#xe9;es par des femmes.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected intermediate outcome for this project includes the sustainable and competitive creation and expansion of microenterprises and small enterprises led by women and men in seven targeted countries in Africa and Latin America.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
